@* 🟢 النسخة Blazor من شاشتين WinForms مختلفتين تبيّن أنهما تتقاسمان بالضبط نفس مفتاح الإعداد الوحيد
   (Static_NotesInInvoicePrintNotShowCustomerAccount عبر Common.Get/Save_SystemParametersDB):
   - Accounts.Requests.Static_NotesInInvoice ("نص بيان الفاتورة")
   - Connection4It.FrmStaticEditSysConfig ("تغيير الإعدادات"، الملف الفعلى StaticInvoiceNotesSysConfig.cs)
   لا فرق وظيفى بينهما أصلاً (حقل نصى واحد + زر حفظ)، فبُنيت صفحة واحدة فقط تخدم مدخلَى القائمة كليهما -
   قرار مؤكَّد مع المستخدم فى .claude/docs/menu-main-data-razor-plan.md. *@
@page "/settings/invoice-notes"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Tr("InvoiceNotesSettingsTitle")</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="1">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Primary" Class="font-weight-bold">@Tr("InvoiceNotesSettingsTitle")</MudText>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="1">
        <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_notes" Label="@Tr("InvoiceNotesLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       Lines="4" FullWidth="true" Disabled="@_isLoading" />
        <MudStack Row="true" Class="mt-4">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Save"
                       OnClick="SaveAsync" Disabled="@(_isLoading || _isBusy)">
                @Tr("Save")
            </MudButton>
        </MudStack>
    </MudPaper>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private const string SettingKey = "Static_NotesInInvoicePrintNotShowCustomerAccount";

    private string _notes = "";
    private bool _isLoading = true;
    private bool _isBusy;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        _isLoading = true;
        try
        {
            _notes = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                return AccountModelsLib.Common.Get_SystemParametersDB(SettingKey) ?? "";
            });
        }
        finally
        {
            _isLoading = false;
        }
    }

    // 🟢 يقابل BtnSave_Click فى كلا الشاشتين الأصليتين بالضبط (حفظ مباشر + رسالة نجاح/خطأ).
    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        _isBusy = true;
        try
        {
            var value = _notes;
            await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                AccountModelsLib.Common.Save_SystemParametersDB(SettingKey, value);
            });
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("InvoiceNotesSaved"), Severity.Success);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("InvoiceNotesSaveError", ex.Message), Severity.Error);
        }
        finally
        {
            _isBusy = false;
        }
    }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }

    public void Dispose()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;
    }
}
